 "name_en": "Customs Management with SAP Global Trade Services (2U1)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Customs Management with SAP Global Trade Services (2U1)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiofbf3588661874b10ada29f1280ab86c3\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofbf3588661874b10ada29f1280ab86c3__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">SAP Global Trade Services Customs Management installations can be integrated with <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> to handle global trade scenarios for import before goods receipt and export management.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">For the following countries/regions SAP Global Trade Services offers an out-of-box certified customs interface for self-filing (import and export):</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Australia (export only)</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Belgium</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">China (paper-based filing / declaration management)</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Denmark</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">France</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Germany</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Netherlands</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">New Zealand (export only)</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Spain</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Sweden</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Switzerland</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">United Kingdom</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">USA</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">For the remaining countries/regions (noncertified), SAP Global Trade Services offers a broker interface:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Customs Broker-centric scenario (import)</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Importer-centric scenario</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Exporter-centric scenario</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofbf3588661874b10ada29f1280ab86c3__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer customers, suppliers, and products from <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> to SAP Global Trade Services</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create customs declaration prior to goods receipt for imports and for exports</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofbf3588661874b10ada29f1280ab86c3__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate SAP Global Trade Services Customs Management with <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Leverage an existing investment in SAP Global Trade Services for a best-of-breed deployment of an international trade solution with minimal new configuration</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>通过 SAP Global Trade Services 的海关管理 (2U1)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiofbf3588661874b10ada29f1280ab86c3\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofbf3588661874b10ada29f1280ab86c3__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">SAP Global Trade Services 海关管理安装可以与 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 集成，以在收货和出口管理之前处理进口的全球贸易场景。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">对于以下国家/地区，SAP Global Trade Services 提供用于自申报（进口和出口）的开箱即用认证海关接口：</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">澳大利亚（仅出口）</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">比利时</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">中国（纸质申报/申报管理）</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">丹麦</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">法国</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">德国</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">荷兰</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">新西兰（仅出口）</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">西班牙</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">瑞典</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">瑞士</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">英国</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">美国</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">对于其余国家/地区（未认证），SAP Global Trade Services 提供代理接口：</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">以报关代理为中心的场景（进口）</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">以进口商为中心的场景</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">以出口商为中心的场景</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofbf3588661874b10ada29f1280ab86c3__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将客户、供应商和产品从 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 传输到 SAP Global Trade Services</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">针对进口和出口，在收货前创建报关单</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofbf3588661874b10ada29f1280ab86c3__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将 SAP Global Trade Services 海关管理与 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 集成</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">利用 SAP Global Trade Services 的现有投资，以最少的新配置以最佳方式部署国际贸易解决方案</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
